Subject: [PATCH] feat: strip invisible links on copy

A custom-url link whose whole text is invisible code points is dropped when copying a message (plain, rich, gift caption, admin log, Markdown/HTML), behind the off-by-default Remove invisible links when copying switch in tele links settings. Port of desktop 0343.
